Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Verification skills for Codex and Claude Code

Keep the verify skill in .agents/skills with a .claude/skills symlink, use
$skill invocation, prove core user journeys rather than one feature, hold
health/evidence/no-leftover invariants in the live pass, and send changed
maps through autoreview. Codex interface metadata for both skills.

